<% content_for :meta_title, "Doug Morgen Work | Rails, Shopify, and Operations Case Studies" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Case studies from Doug Morgen showing fractional CTO and senior engineering work across Rails apps, Shopify systems, internal tools, and accounting migrations." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Work / Case Studies</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-700">Selected builds from production projects I've led and shipped.</p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Homebrand (Rails)</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Built homeowner operations software with document ingestion (PDF/JPG/PNG), OCR extraction, retrieval search, and cited AI assistance for property records.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">ArraFund Commission Platform</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Built a connected Rails app + Shopify app system to track commissions, process campaign-linked orders, and sync webhook-driven data into payout and operations flows.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">BrightGo ERP + Accounting Migration</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Architected hybrid ERP accounting and operations systems, including high-throughput legacy ledger migration, idempotent imports, and penny-perfect reconciliation for teams managing $20M+ annual revenue.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Have a similar challenge?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Share where your bottleneck is and what success looks like. I can usually map first steps quickly.</p>
      <%= link_to "Start a project", start_project_path, class: "btn-primary mt-5" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
